ll screens *\/\n          padding: 0 10px; \/* Optional: Add padding to avoid edge-to-edge display *\/\n        }\n        .our-story-mission-item__desc {\n          font-size: 14px; \/* Adjust font size for better readability *\/\n        }\n        .our-story-mission__title {\n          font-size: 20px; \/* Adjust title size for smaller screens *\/\n        }\n      }\n    <\/style>\n\n    <section class=\"our-story-mission-section\">\n      <div class=\"our-story-mission-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"our-story-mission__subtitle\">OUR MISSION<\/p>\n        <h2 class=\"our-story-mission__title\">\n          Feeling is the key, and our mission is to help people feel better every day. High-THCa and THC products offer a balanced and enjoyable experience, enhancing well-being without compromising your lifestyle. We have been cultivating and crafting premium cannabis. It’s time for a new wave of cannabis that empowers your lifestyle and supports your wellness journey. From flower and edibles to concentrates and wellness products, we’re here to make every day better.\n        <\/h2>\n        <ul class=\"our-story-mission-list\">\n          <li class=\"our-story-mission-item\">\n            <div class=\"our-story-mission-item__img\">\n              <img\n                src=\"\/\/secretnature.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/SN_homepage_pic_1240x.jpg?v=1613714352\"\n                alt=\"The Highest Quality\"\n              \/>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"our-story-mission-item__desc\">\n              <h3>The Highest Quality<\/h3>\n              <p>\n                Indoor grown with organic living soil, plus proper drying and cold curing, produces the highest quality flowers & extracts, and the smoothest, most flavorful smoking experience possible.\n              <\/p>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n  <\/div>\n<\/main>","color_scheme":"","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"custom_liquid_b37mww":{"type